    (410,NULL,'Season 1','{}','2026-04-02 11:30:00+00','2026-04-02 11:30:00+00',1,E'A photograph for a Halloween party takes on a life of its own in a house on Mockingbird Lane, and a loving parody of the popular family sitcom that the audience thought it was watching. Sixty-nine half-hours for Revue and 20th Century Fox, and the copyright was never renewed.

Shot on the backlot at Revue Studios and broadcast in colour from the outset. Every episode ends with the photograph back in the frame on the wall and the family back in the house, which is the whole joke and the whole reason the show works.',NULL,'English','1964-09-23',FALSE,NULL,'United States','{https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFHjuT1EhYmYxCb7zF7HgUzqyiQ.jpg}','{https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/1712/season/1}','{}',NULL,'tv_show','{}','{}',11),
