    (412,NULL,'Season 1','{}','2026-04-03 04:00:00+00','2026-04-03 04:00:00+00',1,E'Six children and a tick-faced dodo walk out of a dimensional portal into the Ahn-Uh-Keh and spend three seasons trying to get home, on a soundstage in a former grocery store in Los Angeles. A Sid and Marty Krofft show for Hanna-Barbera and ABC, and one of the last great Saturday morning series.

Built on a soundstage in a former grocery store in Hollywood, with the portals, the Sleestak walls and the Pylon drawn rather than filmed, and the actors in and out of the creature suits between setups. The last original season on network television before the show was cancelled.',NULL,'English','1974-09-07',FALSE,NULL,'United States','{https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQfkrvxtJNOtG6VE8jqcTVxYt0b.jpg}','{https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/2177/season/1}','{}',NULL,'tv_show','{}','{}',12),
