    (415,NULL,'Season 1','{}','2026-04-04 04:45:00+00','2026-04-04 04:45:00+00',1,E'Four costumed children in fruit suits, a dog called Fleegle and a bumbling Narrator put on a live action show that mixes Hanna-Barbera cartoons with segments that are nothing of the sort. Droopy, Huckleberry Hound, Quick Draw McGraw and the rest rotate underneath them.

A live action segment with four performers in fruit suits, a dog in a hood, a hippopotamus in a suit and a Narrator who never quite keeps up, alternating with Hanna-Barbera cartoons. The later half hours are given over almost entirely to the cartoons, which is where the better material is.',NULL,'English','1968-09-07',FALSE,NULL,'United States','{https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LXfcwGQE38NvnO850DZiiK8fFb.jpg}','{https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23652/season/1}','{}',NULL,'tv_show','{}','{}',13),
