    (417,NULL,'Season 1','{}','2026-04-04 19:45:00+00','2026-04-04 19:45:00+00',1,E'Two agents of a United Network Command for Law and Enforcement, Napoleon Solo and Illya Kuryakin, and a rotating cast of villains with taste in disguises. One hundred and five episodes for MGM over four seasons, and a second, quite different series was made from the same name in the 1980s that is still in copyright.

